# Contact form — Formspree endpoint.
# 1. Create a free form at https://formspree.io
# 2. Copy your endpoint URL (looks like https://formspree.io/f/abcdwxyz)
# 3. Set it below and in your Vercel project's Environment Variables.
# If left unset, the contact form gracefully falls back to opening the visitor's email client.
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENDPOINT=
